Read-only WebKit automation/network-sandbox scope finding
Source version: upstream WebKitGTK tag webkitgtk-2.52.6.
Installed library version previously verified: 2.52.6-0ubuntu0.24.04.2.

WebDriver intentionally requests a remote inspector endpoint:
https://github.com/WebKit/WebKit/blob/webkitgtk-2.52.6/Source/WebDriver/glib/SessionHostGlib.cpp#L149-L171
Relevant line159:
  g_subprocess_launcher_setenv(launcher.get(), "WEBKIT_INSPECTOR_SERVER", inspectorAddress.get(), TRUE);
